#, fuzzy
msgctxt "lblPropertyDescription-branch.categoryOrder:"
msgid "Use this option to change the order of the branch categories of the \\*Branches\\* view. The order is specified using a comma-separated list of following category keys where every category key must occur exactly once in the list:\\n\\n`commits, plugins, flowFeatures, flowHotfixes, flowReleases, flowSupports, localBranches, subtrees, remotes, tags, stashes, metaRefs, otherRefs, lostHeads`"
msgstr "\\*ブランチ\\* ビューのブランチカテゴリの順序を変更するには、このオプションを使用します。順序は、次のカテゴリキーをカンマ区切りで指定します。各カテゴリキーはリスト内に 1 回だけ出現する必要があります:\\n\\n`commits, plugins, flowFeatures, flowHotfixes, flowReleases, flowSupports, localBranches, subtrees, remotes, tags, stashes, metaRefs, otherRefs, lostHeads`"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "lblPropertyDescription-branch.delete.allowToDeleteCurrentBranch:"
